{
    "background_story": "Sweety was a rare Asian elephant with a unique gift - she had a twin sister, Sweetie, who was her exact double. Born in a wildlife sanctuary, the twins were inseparable, sharing a special bond that allowed them to communicate with each other in a way that no one else could understand. As they grew, they became a sensation, with visitors flocking to see the 'double trouble' elephants. Sweety and Sweetie would often play tricks on their handlers, switching places and causing confusion. But despite the mischief, they were incredibly intelligent and gentle, often helping each other out in times of need. Their doubles act became a symbol of the special bond between twins, and Sweety and Sweetie lived happily ever after, side by side.",
